WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.180
Singer's conjecture in dimension four.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.238
Measure holes per copy of the unrolled

3
00:00:05.238 --> 00:00:07.328
space. By duality, one number matters.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.192
Combinatorial group theory shows that first number

5
00:00:11.192 --> 00:00:13.242
is zero for every such group.

6
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.297
Claimed: everything sits in degree two.

7
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:18.544
Not in Lean.
